{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a dark underground crevice where the last safe haven\u2014the Tower\u2014stands against relentless assault. This fusion of tower defense and fast-paced Metroidvania combat challenges you to defend the Tower from waves of enemies while venturing into hostile depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059940/extras/a768c2a3bf22f841a9540e0362900e97.avif?t=1761842768\" width=1200 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle rival factions, uncover runes, and master a fully customizable totem system that reshapes your abilities and playstyle. Every choice matters\u2014whether strengthening your defenses or evolving your combat approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysteries of the Protagonist, the Unpardoned, and the forces threatening the Tower in this atmospheric, lore-rich adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059940/extras/cc2c5ac8e3fe966c6847596b6649d33e.avif?t=1761842768\" width=1200 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic Metroidvania experience fused with strategic Tower Defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat: pogo, slash, and dash through relentless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable builds with stackable runes, fabrics, and totems that drastically change your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary totems that synergize them with your unique playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful runes offering game-changing abilities that shape every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse ranged attacks with the magical element of your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic platforming with dashes, wall jumps, slams, pogos, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face brutal bosses, defend against waves, and venture deep into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059940/extras/e179ba808fca8e8971056f8ae1a12fd1.avif?t=1761842768\" width=1200 height=256 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059940?t=1761842768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059940/4869bb6be512247a08469b67b029051e02cda52c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761842768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059940/ec19cd4995151fd00ca3cb0293e23b6edae62fab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761842768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059940/ec19cd4995151fd00ca3cb0293e23b6edae62fab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761842768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a dark underground crevice where the last safe haven\u2014the Tower\u2014stands against relentless assault. This fusion of tower defense and fast-paced Metroidvania combat challenges you to defend the Tower from waves of enemies while venturing into hostile depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c